+---
+id: task-003-make-applypatch-conform-to-rfc-6902
+type: task
+title: "Make applyPatch conform to RFC 6902"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Request: review how `applyPatch` checks and applies patches and make it conform to RFC 6902, errors included.
+
+Review result: operations, validation, error cases (missing targets, `-` index, out-of-range add, move into
+own child, test mismatch, atomicity) already follow the RFC. One deviation fixed: `replace` was done as
+remove + add, which moved the replaced member to the end of the object; it now replaces in place
+(`replaceValue`). Test added in `test/patch.test.ts`. Removing the whole document still throws, since
+RFC 6902 leaves no representable result.
